    "created_at": "2019-08-30T18:05:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-30T18:05:00Z",
    "body": "Fetch's network error encompasses all network errors (and intentionally hides details). It's modeled as a response as a caller convenience. It also seems rather unlikely it could be changed given the numerous dependencies.",
