    "updated_at": "2019-08-30T18:17:03Z",
    "body": "I would propose 'network error response' as a more precise term for fetch -- for convenience or otherwise, that seems to be what it actually is. Fetch certainly does have more inertia, though; I expected that the widespread usage in other specs would make it the more difficult of the two to change.",
