    "created_at": "2019-08-31T05:12:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-31T05:13:02Z",
    "body": "I think that if we wanted to expose details of network errors we would put those on network error, in a new field. And NEL then has special privileges to look at that field. NEL wouldn't have a separate channel from the fetching layer to the outside.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
